          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Lemmings 3D is a puzzle video game released in 1995, developed by Clockwork Games and published by Psygnosis. The gameplay, like the original Lemmings game, requires the player to lead all the lemmings to their exit by giving them the appropriate \"skills\". It was the first Lemmings game to be rendered in 3D. It was released for DOS, PlayStation, and Sega Saturn, with all three releases being almost identical minus some performance differences.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Lemmings 3D es un videojuego de puzles lanzado en 1995, desarrollado por Clockwork Games y publicado por Psygnosis. La jugabilidad, como en el Lemmings original, consiste en llevar a todos los lemmings a su salida dándoles las \"habilidades\" adecuadas. Fue el primer juego de Lemmings renderizado en 3D. Se lanzó para DOS, PlayStation y Sega Saturn; las tres versiones son casi idénticas, salvo algunas diferencias de rendimiento.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1995",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
